{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-confirm-delete",
  "category": "isp",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-confirm-delete&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "description": "Documentación y demos de iswc-confirm-delete de InSoft.",
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-confirm-delete",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": [
        "Confirmación destructiva \"escribe para confirmar\": el botón Eliminar",
        "          sigue bloqueado hasta que el usuario re-escribe la clave del registro.",
        "          En la demo, el NIT es <code class=\"code\">900123456</code>."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-button id=\"cdBtn\" color=\"danger\">",
            "            <iswc-icon slot=\"start\" icon=\"mdi:trash-can\"></iswc-icon>",
            "            Eliminar tercero",
            "          </iswc-button>",
            "          <iswc-confirm-delete",
            "            id=\"cdDemo\"",
            "            for=\"cdBtn\"",
            "            entity=\"tercero\"",
            "            pk-label=\"NIT\"",
            "            confirm-value=\"900123456\"",
            "            maxlength=\"15\"></iswc-confirm-delete>",
            "          <p id=\"cdLog\">Última acción: <code class=\"code\">—</code></p>"
          ],
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "select",
              "prop": "attr:entity",
              "label": "entity",
              "options": [
                "tercero",
                "plantilla"
              ]
            },
            {
              "control": "select",
              "prop": "attr:pk-label",
              "label": "pk-label",
              "options": [
                "NIT",
                "código"
              ]
            },
            {
              "control": "select",
              "prop": "attr:confirm-value",
              "label": "confirm-value",
              "options": [
                "900123456",
                "PLT-Alfa"
              ]
            },
            {
              "control": "number",
              "prop": "attr:maxlength",
              "label": "maxlength",
              "min": 0,
              "max": 100,
              "step": 1
            },
            {
              "control": "boolean",
              "prop": "attr:case-sensitive",
              "label": "case-sensitive"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sensible",
      "title": "Comparación sensible a mayúsculas",
      "lede": [
        "Por defecto se compara sin distinguir mayúsculas. Con",
        "          <code class=\"code\">case-sensitive</code> la coincidencia debe ser exacta",
        "          (<code class=\"code\">PLT-Alfa</code>)."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-button id=\"cdBtn2\" color=\"danger\" variant=\"outlined\">Eliminar plantilla</iswc-button>",
            "          <iswc-confirm-delete",
            "            for=\"cdBtn2\"",
            "            case-sensitive",
            "            entity=\"plantilla\"",
            "            pk-label=\"código\"",
            "            confirm-value=\"PLT-Alfa\"",
            "            message=\"Esta plantilla se usa en 12 documentos. No hay vuelta atrás.\"></iswc-confirm-delete>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cuando",
      "title": "Cuándo NO usarlo",
      "lede": [
        "Para confirmaciones ordinarias siguen estando",
        "          <code class=\"code\">&lt;iswc-confirm-modal&gt;</code> y",
        "          <code class=\"code\">&lt;iswc-popconfirm&gt;</code>. La fricción de re-escribir la clave",
        "          solo se justifica si el dato no se puede recuperar."
      ],
      "blocks": []
    }
  ],
  "ficha": {
    "sections": {
      "anatomia": {
        "content": [
          "Confirmación destructiva \"escribe para confirmar\": el botón Eliminar",
          "          sigue bloqueado hasta que el usuario re-escribe la clave del registro.",
          "          En la demo, el NIT es <code class=\"code\">900123456</code>."
        ]
      },
      "ejemplos": {
        "content": [
          "```html",
          "<iswc-button id=\"del\" color=\"danger\">Eliminar</iswc-button>",
          "<iswc-confirm-delete for=\"del\" entity=\"tercero\"",
          "  pk-label=\"NIT\" confirm-value=\"900123456\"></iswc-confirm-delete>",
          "```"
        ]
      }
    },
    "exclude": [
      "apiJs",
      "atributos",
      "eventos",
      "parts",
      "props",
      "slots",
      "states"
    ]
  }
}
